{"name": "Knightstones", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/baa2957243b3bcc3ff5c4ef446afced9.poster.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/baa2957243b3bcc3ff5c4ef446afced9.webm?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/baa2957243b3bcc3ff5c4ef446afced9.mp4?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Knightstones is a first person roguelite auto battler that blends turn based planning, real time battles, and resource management, all wrapped in a unique visual style. Your choices will shape the fate of the Order.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras_big/80b2dce12b57544103be90cf36ada12d.webp?t=1787248646\" height=\"222\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/80b2dce12b57544103be90cf36ada12d.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/6dda2e56407a0edebd49bf3a238a6e0b.poster.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/6dda2e56407a0edebd49bf3a238a6e0b.webm?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/6dda2e56407a0edebd49bf3a238a6e0b.mp4?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an <strong>immersive single player campaign</strong>. Take command of the <strong>Athare Order</strong>, the last bastion standing against the <strong>Inquisition</strong> determined to eradicate your faith. <strong>Master the relics of the Order\u2019s former leaders and uncover the secrets behind this endless war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"222\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/f143d7cbffafcd049463fd67155ad806.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/aa9a2066b11c41781c65e3a0a2ae481e.poster.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/aa9a2066b11c41781c65e3a0a2ae481e.webm?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/aa9a2066b11c41781c65e3a0a2ae481e.mp4?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From your war table, move your army across the campaign map and eliminate enemy outposts.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>25+ Order Fighters -</strong> Build devastating squads by combining their abilities and synergies to gain the upper hand in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>400+ upgrades -</strong> Level up your Fighters and unlock increasingly destructive powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>200+ buffs -</strong> Adapt your playstyle with a wide variety of equipment and spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"222\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/275dbb0440a9b4fd47d21436ab69952c.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/85160e9790c598ee4aaf6646eb6efc90.poster.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/85160e9790c598ee4aaf6646eb6efc90.webm?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/85160e9790c598ee4aaf6646eb6efc90.mp4?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your Order is in decline. Plan new constructions and recruit fresh forces to restore its former glory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rebuild -</strong> Construct new buildings to gather valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruit -</strong> Attract new Adepts, train them, and strengthen your forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade -</strong> Increase your Fighters\u2019 power and return to the battlefield with devastating effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"222\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/38453e04bbb96d46e46bac022f1446e7.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/573e74a181ff2f8b503c7cff88444446.poster.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/573e74a181ff2f8b503c7cff88444446.webm?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/573e74a181ff2f8b503c7cff88444446.mp4?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During each run, the Lords of the Inquisition will take turns trying to destroy your Order. Will you withstand their immense power and survive until the final siege?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 Bosses -</strong> The Lords of the Inquisition are ruthless warriors who will put your skills to the test. Do not let them dominate the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 Mini Bosses -</strong> Inquisition captains provide difficult but optional challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras_big/9557bb2dba45699af83f4988f972301e.webp?t=1787248646\" height=\"222\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/9557bb2dba45699af83f4988f972301e.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong> </strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/1d25a0ad7ec6b021e600a72733b3cc33.poster.avif?t=1787248646\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/1d25a0ad7ec6b021e600a72733b3cc33.webm?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/extras/1d25a0ad7ec6b021e600a72733b3cc33.mp4?t=1787248646\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the distinctive visual and audio world of Knightstones.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ illustrations -</strong> Every Fighter and every enemy has been carefully illustrated by a talented artist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First Person -</strong> The first person perspective creates a unique sense of immersion. Explore the ruins of the temple where every detail has been carefully placed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A living world -</strong> Expand your Order at the foot of the fortress. Watch your armies take position for the final battle and witness the epic assaults led by the mighty Lords of the Inquisition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Message from the developer:</strong></i><br/><i>Thank you to every player who has added the game to their wishlist, left a review on the demo page, sent a message, or shown support in any way. As a solo developer, this means an incredible amount to me and greatly helps me deliver the best possible experience. THANK YOU.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Knightstones is a first person roguelite auto battler that blends turn based planning, real time battles, and resource management, all within a unique visual style.</strong><br/><strong>Many challenges await you in the campaign against the Third Inquisition.</strong><br/><strong>Fulfill your duty, or perish trying.</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Lead your troops on your war table in this unique roguelite auto-battler. Deploy your decks of elite warriors, trigger devastating chain reactions, and invest your rewards to rebuild your fallen Order. Be ready\u2026 or perish in the final battle.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543400/808392d0a7a81877ccec6bb246869a6319137f86/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1787248646", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Roguelite", "PvE", "Deckbuilding", "Story Rich"], "developers": "WillGreen Studio", "publishers": "WillGreen Studio", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3543400", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/2xSOWB1fzmM", "first_seen": 1776376800.0, "review_rank": 826}